  A5 fix — the A5 fix moved heartbeat/session-closing to `sendAsync`; check whether
  `ZoneChangedNotify` pushes still go through a synchronous path that can block on the state lane);
  a DONTWAIT/BACKPRESSURED completion not resubmitted (WRITABLE) on the gateway's STREAM socket.
- Reproduce: `ZLINK_ZONEWORLD_SCENARIOS`-style selector if the runner supports one (read
